## Assumption Summary

- **Total assumptions:** 12
- **High-risk assumptions (Medium likelihood or above, combined with Medium+ severity):** A02 (Mann-Whitney independence), A04 (seasonal stability across 3 years), A10 (benchmark evaluated independently of planner judgement), A12 (non-significance misread as no effect)
- **Critical-severity assumptions:** A06 (store generalization) carries Critical severity if violated downstream, despite low likelihood within this project's own discipline; A11 (evidence-only recommendation confidence) carries High severity if the governance rule is not maintained
- **Assumptions requiring future validation:** A04 (year-over-year seasonal stability — not yet checked) and A10 (planner-vs-benchmark comparison — data does not yet exist to test this)
- **Assumptions intentionally left unresolved:** A07 (ROI is not estimated, by design, until cost data becomes available) and A10 (the benchmark-vs-planner comparison is deliberately left open rather than assumed in either direction)

No assumption in this register is presented as resolved when it is not. Where an assumption cannot yet be tested, this register states that directly rather than defaulting to an implicit "accepted" status.
